# electrodes with constant potential using finite field
# for z-periodic graphene-ionic liquid supercapacitor

boundary p p p # ffield uses periodic z-boundary and no slab
include settings.mod # styles, groups, computes and fixes

fix conp bot electrode/conp -1.0 eta 1.979 couple top 1.0 etypes on ffield yes qtotal 2

thermo 50
thermo_style custom step temp c_ctemp epair etotal c_qbot c_qtop f_conp[1] f_conp[2]
run 500
